# Likeness Looter's copy ability with X=0 at Walking Ballista ({X}{X}, "enters with X +1/+1 counters", 0/0). "If a card
# in your graveyard has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0" (the ruling, CR 107.3, 202.3): the Ballista has
# mana value 0, so X=0 targets it. The Looter becomes a 0/0 Walking Ballista with flying and no counters - it doesn't
# enter, so "enters with" doesn't apply (the ruling, CR 614.12) - and dies to state-based actions (CR 704.5f): the
# Likeness Looter card is put into Bot1's graveyard beside the Ballista.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Mox Jet
Mox Sapphire
Likeness Looter
Walking Ballista
Island x2
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Likeness Looter.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Likeness Looter.Activate(Ability: Draw a card)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Choose(Walking Ballista)
Bot1.Battlefield.Likeness Looter.Activate(Ability: becomes a copy; X: 0)
Bot1.Target(Walking Ballista)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Stack.Count = 0
Bot1.Battlefield = Island; Mox Jet; Mox Sapphire
Bot1.Graveyard = Likeness Looter; Walking Ballista
